OL,3,GNEWSAI picked West Brom on Fifa - now
OL,4,AI'm flying 5,000 miles to watch them
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor years, Jay Jhaver has been waking
OL,7,Fup before dawn in Arizona to watch West
OL,8,FBromwich Albion matches most people
OL,9,Faround him have never heard of.
OL,11,FNow the fan, who lives about 5,000
OL,12,Fmiles (8,046 km) from The Hawthorns, is
OL,13,Fmaking the journey to England for the
OL,14,Ffirst time to see the club he has
OL,15,Ffollowed since choosing it at random on
OL,16,Fa Fifa video game.
OL,18,FJhaver, from Phoenix, believes he may
OL,19,Fbe the only West Brom supporter in the
OL,20,FUS state of Arizona and will finally
OL,21,Fwatch his team in person when they host
OL,22,FBlackburn Rovers on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
