OL,3,GNEWSAI picked West Brom on Fifa - now
OL,4,AI'm flying 5,000 miles to watch them
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis unlikely love affair with the
OL,7,FBaggies began when he was looking for a
OL,8,Fteam to play as on Fifa and settled on
OL,9,FWest Brom by chance.
